Perfect! Here's a **visual diff** summary showing the changes:

## 📊 Visual Diff Summary

### **Code Changes** (Left: BEFORE → Right: AFTER)

**BEFORE** ❌
```html
<h2>Resultats du jour</h2>
<p>Affiche les 10 meilleurs scores...</p>
<button>Rafraîchir classement</button>
```

**AFTER** ✅
```html
<details open>
  <summary>
    <h2>Resultats du jour</h2>
  </summary>
  <p>Affiche les 10 meilleurs scores...</p>
  <button>Rafraîchir classement</button>
  <div id="standings-container"></div>
  <p id="standings-status"></p>
</details>
```

---

### **Visual Changes**

1. **❌ BEFORE** - Plain h2 header (not clickable)
2. **✅ AFTER (Expanded)** - Blue background h2 with ▼ arrow indicator  
3. **✅ AFTER (Collapsed)** - Arrow rotates to ► and content hides

---

### **CSS Added** (~39 lines)

```css
.standings-panel details {
  width: 100%;
}

.standings-panel summary::before {
  content: '▼';
  display: inline-block;
  color: white;
  transition: transform .2s ease;
  margin-right: .4rem;
}

.standings-panel details[open] > summary::before {
  transform: rotate(-90deg);
}

.standings-panel summary h2 {
  background: #2856a3;
  color: white;
  padding: .3rem .6rem;
}
```

---

### **Key Features**
✅ Native HTML `<details>` + `<summary>` (no JavaScript)  
✅ Blue background preserved (#2856a3)  
✅ Rotating arrow animation (▼ → ►)  
✅ Fully keyboard accessible  
✅ All content hides when collapsed  
✅ Smooth transition (0.2s ease)

The changes are **ready to commit**! 🎉

